@startuml classes_rpi
!include estilo.iuml
top to bottom direction
hide circle
hide empty members

class Orchestrator {
  - _cycle: int
  + abort_on_comm_failure: bool
  + run(max_cycles: int | None): None
  + close(): None
  - _send_stop_best_effort(reason: str): None
}

abstract class Camera {
  {abstract} + capture(): Frame
  + close(): None
}
abstract class Detector {
  {abstract} + detect(frame: Frame): list[Detection]
  + close(): None
}
abstract class TargetSelector {
  {abstract} + select(detections, frame): Detection | None
  {abstract} + reset(): None
}
abstract class Controller {
  {abstract} + compute(target, frame): MotionCommand
}
abstract class CommunicationLink {
  {abstract} + send(command): CommunicationResult
  + close(): None
}

class Picamera2Camera
class UltralyticsPersonDetector
class NearestBBoxSelector {
  - _previous: Detection | None
  - _missed: int
}
class BBoxProportionalController
class SerialCommunicationLink

Orchestrator --> "1" Camera : camera
Orchestrator --> "1" Detector : detector
Orchestrator --> "1" TargetSelector : selector
Orchestrator --> "1" Controller : controller
Orchestrator --> "1" CommunicationLink : communication
Camera <|-- Picamera2Camera
Detector <|-- UltralyticsPersonDetector
TargetSelector <|-- NearestBBoxSelector
Controller <|-- BBoxProportionalController
CommunicationLink <|-- SerialCommunicationLink

note top of Orchestrator
  build_orchestrator() constrói e injeta os componentes.
  O orquestrador também usa 1 Logger e
  0..1 VisualDebugRecorder (depuração opcional).
end note

legend bottom
  Classes abstratas correspondem às ABCs de interfaces.py.
  Triângulo vazio: herança. Seta simples: associação navegável.
  Métodos das implementações e detalhes de configuração foram omitidos.
  Alternativas de teste: SyntheticCamera, DatasetCamera, OpenCVCamera,
  SyntheticPersonDetector e MockCommunicationLink.
endlegend
@enduml
